OL,3,A'He was our hero,' says family of
OL,4,Apolice officer killed in car crash near
OL,5,AMiddlesbrough
OL,6,
OL,7,FMichael Robert Cahill, 23, Theo Rae,
OL,8,F17, Cole Robert Worthy, 17, Jakub
OL,9,FMatusiak, 23, and Makai Saddington, 18
OL,10,Fdied in the crash
OL,12,FThe police watchdog, the IOPC, says the
OL,13,Fcrash happened about 10 seconds after
OL,14,Fthe police pursuit ended - here's their
OL,15,Fstatement in full
OL,17,FThe collision happened shortly after
OL,18,F03:30 BST on Saturday when a car
OL,19,Ftravelling the wrong direction collided
OL,20,Fwith a marked police vehicle
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
