OL,3,ACrossCountry cancels 'almost all' UK
OL,4,Aservices after power cut
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport Secretary Heidi Alexander
OL,7,Fsaid she was "concerned to hear about a
OL,8,Fpower outage" and had asked publicly
OL,9,Fowned operators to provide "extra
OL,10,Fservices where possible".
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
